### ==========================================================================
### NeonPulse Ticketing Platform - API Contract Testing (Hito 4)
### Test collection for Bruno, Postman or VS Code REST Client
### ==========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Consultar Catálogo Completo de Eventos
GET {{baseUrl}}/events
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Consultar Evento Específico por ID (EVT-001)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/EVT-001
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Consultar Evento Inexistente (Caso 404 NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/EVT-999
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Crear Reserva de Entradas Exitosa (Cliente VIP con 20% descuento)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "eventId": "EVT-001",
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### 5. Crear Reserva con Cantidad Inválida (Caso 400 BAD_REQUEST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "eventId": "EVT-001",
  "quantity": 0
}

###

### 6. Crear Reserva en Evento Agotado (Caso 409 CONFLICT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-002",
  "eventId": "EVT-003",
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### 7. Consultar Documentación OpenAPI / Swagger-UI (Solo perfil dev)
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs
Accept: application/json
